      "feedback": "自动测试：7/15。\n用例 a3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive。\n用例 a4，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive。\n用例 a7，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmActive, highHigh。\n用例 alarm-edge-2，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive, highHigh。\n用例 alarm-edge-3，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive, highHigh。\n用例 alarm-edge-5，模式 sequence，行为不匹配，请检查 alarmAcked, alarmActive, highHigh。\nLTL 检查：not_run。",
      "idx": 0,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK FB\nVAR_INPUT\n    flowLow   : BOOL;\n    ackBtn    : BOOL;\n    sensorOK  : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    alarmActive : BOOL;\n    alarmAcked  : BOOL;\n    highHigh    : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR\n    prev_ackBtn   : BOOL;    (* Previous cycle ackBtn state for rising edge detection *)\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR_TEMP\n    rising_ackBtn : BOOL;    (* Rising edge of ackBtn in current cycle *)\nEND_VAR\n\n// Detect rising edge of acknowledge button\nrising_ackBtn := ackBtn AND NOT prev_ackBtn;\n\n// S5: High priority alarm - sensor failure\nhighHigh := NOT sensorOK;\n\n// Low priority alarm state machine\n// Priority: reset alarmAcked on new flowLow > acknowledge on rising edge > clear on condition gone + acknowledged\n\nIF flowLow THEN\n    // Condition occurred: activate alarm, reset acknowledgment\n    alarmActive := TRUE;\n    alarmAcked := FALSE;\n    \nELSIF rising_ackBtn AND alarmActive THEN\n    // Acknowledge button pressed while alarm active\n    alarmAcked := TRUE;\n    \nELSIF NOT flowLow AND alarmAcked THEN\n    // Condition cleared and already acknowledged: clear alarm\n    alarmActive := FALSE;\n    alarmAcked := FALSE;\n    \nEND_IF;\n\n// Update previous state for next cycle\nprev_ackBtn := ackBtn;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
      "code_hash": "dc655f83d38a0d99a188371807cba4b8fb436ccb12e03538dc1ea608402cae55",
